# pc-power-cap: c is master, aa its A/A copy, pk master with a POW-18 power-cap: line (every main-gun shot at most
# 0.2) for each robot of plans/power-cap-add.txt and a power-cap5: line (at most 0.5) for each robot of
# plans/power-cap5-add.txt. Each line acts on its own robot only.
c | hadur117.Hadur 3.22 | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.22.jar
aa | hadur117.Hadur 3.22aa | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.22aa.jar
pk | hadur117.Hadur 3.22pkp5 | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.22pkp5.jar
